@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events shown on the account timeline: cards added, moved, closed, renamed, assigned, commented on, and more. Use this endpoint to consume the account activity feed from an API client.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity the current user can access, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the user who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohde",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "description": "David assigned Kevin to &quot;Fix the login page&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zppzlksuj4mxba2nbzn"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "Fix the login page",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+The `eventable`, `board`, and `creator` objects use the same representations as the [cards](cards.md), [comments](comments.md), [boards](boards.md), and [users](users.md) endpoints.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, `url` opens the card where the comment was posted and jumps to the comment.
+
+### Particulars
+
+Some actions include additional details in `particulars`:
+
+| Action | Details |
+|--------|---------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+
+All other actions return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+Deprecated `card_collection_changed` events are not returned.
